# Test script for KIM potential with Argon
# This tests if LAMMPS has KIM package properly installed

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p

# KIM potential initialization MUST come before create_box
# Using a well-known Lennard-Jones potential for Argon from OpenKIM
kim init LJ_Shifted_Bernardes_1958MedCutoff_Ar__MO_126566794224_004 metal
#=== KIM is looking for 'Portable Models' in these directories ===
#  1: .
#  2: /path/to/.kim-api/2.4.0-git+Clang.Clang.GNU.2025-03-25-17-46-17/portable-models-dir
#  3: /path/to/miniconda3/envs/md-studio/lib/openkim-models/portable-models
#=== KIM is looking for 'Simulator Models' in these directories ===
#  1: .
#  2: /path/to/.kim-api/2.4.0-git+Clang.Clang.GNU.2025-03-25-17-46-17/simulator-models-dir
#  3: /path/to/miniconda3/envs/md-studio/lib/openkim-models/simulator-models
#=== BEGIN kim init ==========================================
units metal
neighbor 2.0 bin   # Angstroms
timestep 1.0e-3    # picoseconds

This model has 3 mutable parameters. 
 No.      | Parameter name     | data type  | extent
-----------------------------------------------------
 1        | cutoff             | "Double"   | 1
 2        | epsilon            | "Double"   | 1
 3        | sigma              | "Double"   | 1
#=== END kim init ============================================


lattice fcc 5.26
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.26 5.26 5.26
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (15.78 15.78 15.78)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 108 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (15.78 15.78 15.78)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

# Set up KIM interactions after create_box
kim interactions Ar
#=== BEGIN kim interactions ==================================
pair_style kim LJ_Shifted_Bernardes_1958MedCutoff_Ar__MO_126566794224_004
pair_coeff * * Ar
#=== END kim interactions ====================================


# Set mass for argon (KIM doesn't automatically set masses)
mass 1 39.948

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 20 check no

fix 1 all nve

thermo 10
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol density

dump 1 all atom 50 dump.atom

timestep 0.001
run 50

